    "detailed_description": "In Crystals, you play as a kid who accidentally traveled to another Dimension, which is being terrorized by a ruthless Dimensional Warrior. It's up to our protagonist to defeat Dimensio and restore peace in the Dimension, so that he can return back home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/fec14707dcaee361e5f355e7f6980696.poster.avif?t=1710622871\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/fec14707dcaee361e5f355e7f6980696.webm?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/fec14707dcaee361e5f355e7f6980696.mp4?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Crystals, you can:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore areas based on elements such as fire, water, earth, electricity (bet you didn't expect this one) and sky<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/8c889fa431d3eb20aa6b7d5173c73d46.poster.avif?t=1710622871\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/8c889fa431d3eb20aa6b7d5173c73d46.webm?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/8c889fa431d3eb20aa6b7d5173c73d46.mp4?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Fight original enemies and avoid their attacks with a platformer-based system (don't worry you don't actually kill the enemies)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/06d26f72c7bc8946745a95344b6c37a8.poster.avif?t=1710622871\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/06d26f72c7bc8946745a95344b6c37a8.webm?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/06d26f72c7bc8946745a95344b6c37a8.mp4?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Unlock abilities throughout the game by collecting crystals</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/a51ffc1f691a5b0e7c2ed339a31d4e4a.poster.avif?t=1710622871\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/a51ffc1f691a5b0e7c2ed339a31d4e4a.webm?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/a51ffc1f691a5b0e7c2ed339a31d4e4a.mp4?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Encounter special characters, fight against challenging enemies and intimidating bosses, live a story that you'll enjoy (how could you not like a game about a kid who barely knows basic math going to fight a bloody warrior who's able to tear apart a whole Dimension?)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/1941d1503566db84ea8b0de90a676801.poster.avif?t=1710622871\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/1941d1503566db84ea8b0de90a676801.webm?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/1941d1503566db84ea8b0de90a676801.mp4?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/ab13abc30c9912db5a2338bf2b885f20.poster.avif?t=1710622871\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/ab13abc30c9912db5a2338bf2b885f20.webm?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779180/extras/ab13abc30c9912db5a2338bf2b885f20.mp4?t=1710622871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
